From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 6 Nov 2026 18:05:48 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] perf(shell): spike two CSS quick fixes for the side panel
 and context bar

The side panel (SplitView) no longer animates its flex-basis: nothing held
the grid beside it, so react-grid-layout and every chart laid out on each
frame of the slide. The context bar's hidden separator keeps its 1 px: with
flex-basis 0 it grew to 1 px in the same commit that opened the bar, before
useMainLock measured main, so main was pinned 1 px narrow and every chart
laid out mid-slide.

Spike for review (docs/REVIEW/perf/README.md), not for main as it is.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SvxHHPGWNijwKVz2Xk4M3m
---
 src/shell/Shell.module.css                       | 3 ++-
 src/ui/components/SplitView/SplitView.module.css | 7 +++----
 2 files changed, 5 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/shell/Shell.module.css b/src/shell/Shell.module.css
index c7a4028..8daa9d4 100644
--- a/src/shell/Shell.module.css
+++ b/src/shell/Shell.module.css
@@ -141,11 +141,12 @@
     --splitter-handle-color: var(--mantine-primary-color-filled);
   }
 
+  /* Quick fix (spike): keep the hidden separator 1px wide, so opening the context bar doesn't narrow
+     main by 1px before useMainLock measures it. */
   .pane[data-fixed] + &,
   &:has(+ .pane[data-fixed]) {
     pointer-events: none;
     visibility: hidden;
-    flex-basis: 0;
   }
 
   .sidebarPane[data-fixed]:not([data-collapsed]) + & {
diff --git a/src/ui/components/SplitView/SplitView.module.css b/src/ui/components/SplitView/SplitView.module.css
index a1e427d..c518313 100644
--- a/src/ui/components/SplitView/SplitView.module.css
+++ b/src/ui/components/SplitView/SplitView.module.css
@@ -17,10 +17,9 @@
   display: flex;
   flex-direction: column;
 
-  /* Animate open, compact and close; not while the user drags. Reduced motion zeroes the token. */
-  .frame:not([data-resizing]) & {
-    transition: flex-basis var(--app-motion-duration-base) var(--app-motion-easing-standard);
-  }
+  /* Quick fix (spike): no flex-basis transition on open, compact and close. Nothing froze the grid
+     beside the side panel, so it and every chart laid out on each frame of the slide; now they lay out
+     once. */
 
   /* Pane content can switch layout by its own width as it is dragged. */
   container-type: inline-size;
